/// Ask for information or a decision that blocks the current goal. The run
/// pauses durably and the person answers in Nexus. Reuse earlier answers and
/// choose sensible defaults for minor preferences. Approval to access a
/// computer is a separate requestComputerUseScope decision.
@handler(type="function", name="requestUserFeedback")
@requiresAgentRole("assistant", "specialist")
@executionTime("fast")
tool requestUserFeedback {
  question     string! @description("The question to put to the user. Be specific and self-contained -- the user sees only this text on the card, not the chat history. State exactly what you need and why.")
  kind         enum("choice", "text", "multi")! @description("Response widget. choice = pick exactly one of `options`. multi = pick one or more of `options`. text = free-form (also the path for a file the user drops in Ask). Pick choice/multi whenever the answer space is bounded -- it is faster and less error-prone for the user.")
  options      array   @description("For kind=choice / multi: the selectable answers, each an object {label, value}. label is shown to the user; value is what comes back in the recorded answer. Omit for kind=text.")
  timeoutAt    string  @description("Optional RFC3339 expiry for this question. Omit for the platform default.")
  runId        string  @autoInjected @description("The active run to park. Server-stamped from the agent runtime turn context; the central validator drops any LLM-supplied value before dispatch (memql#107). Was planId until memql#5053 -- the question is now a v1:work:approval of kind feedback, raised against the run.")
  agentId      string  @autoInjected @description("Calling agent id. Server-stamped from the agent runtime; the central validator drops any LLM-supplied value before dispatch.")
  ownerUserId  string  @autoInjected @description("Session-owner user id. Server-stamped; scopes the parked Plan's owner attribution. The central validator drops any LLM-supplied value.")
  partitionId      string  @autoInjected @description("Target space for the canvas card. Server-stamped from the agent runtime; the central validator drops any LLM-supplied value.")
}
